                <pb facs="0456" n="434" xml:id="pg434"/>
                <p>In a short plenary session, at which <hi rendition="#small-caps">Mr. Molotov</hi>
                    presided, the agreements concerning the revision of the Italian armistice terms
                    were signed by the four Ministers (copy of revised terms attached).<anchor
                        n="77" xml:id="d142-f2"/></p>
                <p>It was agreed that these were not to be made public until signed by the Allied
                    Commander-in-Chief and the Italian Government.<anchor n="78" xml:id="d142-f3"
                    /></p>
