    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d142-f1" n="76" type="source" xml:id="d142-f1-content">
                <p>There was no Record of Decisions for this meeting. In his telegram 2405, Delsec 513, May 16, from Paris, not printed, the
                    Secretary reported to the President and the Acting Secretary about this brief
                    meeting (740.00119 Council/5–1646).</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d142-f2" n="77" xml:id="d142-f2-content">
                <p>The Revision of the Italian Armistice Terms, as approved by the Council, was
                    circulated as document C.F.M. (46) 95, May 16,
                    1946, <ref target="#pg436">p. 436</ref>.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d142-f3" n="78" xml:id="d142-f3-content">
                <p>The agreement was, in fact, never signed; for additional documentation on this
                    subject, see <ref target="frus1946v05#pg_825">vol. <hi rendition="#small-caps"
                            >v</hi>, pp. 825</ref> ff.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
